## Upstream firmware

`firmware/` is a fork of the official M5Stack Stack-chan firmware:

  https://github.com/m5stack/StackChan (directory `firmware/`)
  Commit: 28b9f0c8bd6acd81cb3c70f1a93c3e373b39d400 (2026-11-04)
  Copyright (c) 2026 M5Stack Technology CO LTD — MIT License

Original SPDX headers are kept on the files that came from upstream.
Stack-chan itself was created by Shinya Ishikawa (@stack_chan) and grown by the
Stack-chan community, notably Takao Akaki (@mongonta555).

## Dependencies fetched at build time (see `firmware/repos.json`)

- xiaozhi-esp32 v2.5.2 — https://github.com/78/xiaozhi-esp32 — MIT
  (voice pipeline, echo cancellation, wake word, display stack; Chan applies
  `firmware/patches/xiaozhi-esp32.patch` on top)
- mooncake v2.3.3, mooncake_log v1.5.0, smooth_ui_toolkit v2.12.0 —
  https://github.com/Forairaaaaa — MIT
- ArduinoJson v7.4.2 — https://github.com/bblanchon/ArduinoJson — MIT
- esp-now — https://github.com/espressif/esp-now — Apache-2.0
- ESP-IDF component registry packages listed in `firmware/main/idf_component.yml`
  (Espressif and others; licenses in each package)

